
Brainstorming & Ideation Phase
Problem Identified:
Students often find it hard to understand new topics quickly and don't have an easy way to test their own understanding.
Idea:
Build an AI-powered learning assistant using the Google Gemini API that can explain topics simply, summarize them, and generate quizzes for self-testing.
Why This Idea:
Combines three useful learning tools (explain, summarize, quiz) in one app
Uses generative AI to give personalized, on-demand help
Simple enough to build and demo within the project timeline
Project Name Chosen: EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant
